  "description": "YITAMotor floor mats are made with high-density TPE material, using advanced 3D laser technology, which not only provides a superb feel and extreme wear resistance but also offers a precise fit to your vehicle floor.\nFitment\n2023-2026 Honda Accord\n2023-2026 Honda Accord Hybrid\nDoes not fit vehicles with vinyl flooring, only for carpet flooring.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: These floor mats are compatible with the 2023 2024 2025 2026 Honda Accord (Including Hybrid), not for vehicles with vinyl floors; 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and back, Please remove old floor mats before installing new ones.\nBuilt For Durability: YITAMOTOR floor liners are compatible with the 2023 2024 2025 2026 Honda Accord Hybrid, made from premium TPE material featuring high tensity for great comfort and wear-resistance while remaining flexible and user-friendly even in extreme cold or hot environments; The Product contains no latex, or cadmium, lead, or any harmful PVC.\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: Uniquely designed channels and raised edges can effectively trap liquid, debris, snow, mud, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean; Built-in retainer clips firmly grip the mat and prevent slipping when wet.\nEasy To Clean: Simply shake the dirt out of the textured skid-resistant surface or spray down with a hose; No vacuuming or harsh chemicals are needed for maintenance.\nWhy Choose Yitamotor: Our floor mats are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard to your vehicle; Our excellent pre- and after-sales services are always available to ensure your purchase is hassle-free.",
